> 7. Why am I sometimes asked "Really attack the XYZ-Monster?"? And
> sometimes I am not promted, eventhough it's the same type of monster.
> Quite random...

Use '/' command and check to see what kind of monsters they are.  Some of
them are 'peaceful' and leave you alone if you leave them alone.  Prime
example of those types of monsters are Shopkeepers and Watchmen.  However,
some monsters are also randomly peaceful (Often depends on the alignment of
the monsters and your alignment).  Sometimes, you can make monsters peaceful
as well if you do nice thing to them.

